      "alt": "STKLX2160A board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on the TQMLX2160A Embedded Cortex®-A72 module</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKLX2160A, an evaluation kit based on TQMLX2160A, offers embedded computing engineers a robust platform for development. Key features include 10G/100G Ethernet support, high-speed communication through 24x SerDes lanes, 2x DDR4 memory with ECC support, a powerful 100Gb/s Data Compression Engine, and versatile connectivity options like 2x CAN FD, 2x USB 3.0, and PCIe Gen4. Integrated security functions provide enhanced data protection. The STKLX2160A-Set, centered around the TQMLX2160A module with 16x Cortex®-A72 CPUs, facilitates the rapid development of ultra-high-speed interfaces and custom hardware solutions. Explore the possibilities of embedded computing with Macnica and TQ Systems.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 10:55:22 GMT+0000",
